1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Video ya leo inahusu nini? Unaplanu safari wakati wa kiangazi? Hokkaido! Okinawa!

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:13,008
Sehemu ya 1: Safari ya Kiangazi: Hokkaido au Okinawa

3
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:17,977
Tufikirie safari ya kiangazi mwaka huu.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,634
Sawa sawa.

5
00:00:20,657 --> 00:00:25,204
Ninapenda Hokkaido au Okinawa.

6
00:00:25,227 --> 00:00:28,702
Ziwa zipi zinazopendwa zaidi?

7
00:00:28,726 --> 00:00:34,959
Zote mbili ni maarufu kwa ajili ya safari za kiangazi.

8
00:00:34,982 --> 00:00:39,615
Je, Hokkaido ni baridi wakati wa kiangazi?

9
00:00:39,638 --> 00:00:45,738
Ndiyo, ni baridi sana kuliko Tokyo.

10
00:00:45,761 --> 00:00:49,912
Halijoto ni takribani digrii ishirini na tano.

11
00:00:49,936 --> 00:00:54,046
Hiyo ni rahisi kwa kukaa.

12
00:00:54,069 --> 00:00:57,538
Je, Okinawa inaendelea vipi?

13
00:00:57,561 --> 00:01:01,996
Okinawa ni joto sana.

14
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:06,724
Halijoto inafikia digrii thelathini na mbili hivi.

15
00:01:06,748 --> 00:01:10,667
Digrii thelathini na mbili ni joto mno.

16
00:01:10,691 --> 00:01:15,275
Lakini bahari ni nzuri sana.

17
00:01:15,298 --> 00:01:17,767
Ndiyo.

18
00:01:17,790 --> 00:01:22,502
Bahari ya buluu ni ya ajabu kweli.

19
00:01:22,526 --> 00:01:27,226
Hokkaido haina bahari?

20
00:01:27,249 --> 00:01:31,806
Hokkaido pia ina bahari.

21
00:01:31,829 --> 00:01:36,330
Lakini watu wachache hupenda kuogelea.

22
00:01:36,353 --> 00:01:39,744
Je, maji ni baridi?

23
00:01:39,768 --> 00:01:42,242
Ndiyo.

24
00:01:42,265 --> 00:01:45,932
Hata wakati wa kiangazi, maji ni baridi kidogo.

25
00:01:45,955 --> 00:01:49,422
Nimeelewa.

26
00:01:49,445 --> 00:01:53,578
Je, maji ya bahari ya Okinawa ni vuguvugu?

27
00:01:53,601 --> 00:01:58,919
Ndiyo, unaweza kuogelea hadi mwezi wa tisa.

28
00:01:58,942 --> 00:02:03,700
Hali ya hewa na bahari ni tofauti kabisa.

29
00:02:03,724 --> 00:02:05,881
Ndiyo, ni tofauti kabisa.

30
00:02:05,904 --> 00:02:09,441
Chakula pia ni tofauti.

31
00:02:09,465 --> 00:02:13,171
Kuna aina gani za chakula?

32
00:02:13,194 --> 00:02:18,150
Hokkaido ina samaki tamu sana.

33
00:02:18,173 --> 00:02:22,606
Okinawa ina maembe.

34
00:02:22,629 --> 00:02:26,529
Zote mbili ni za kuvutia.

35
00:02:26,552 --> 00:02:33,657
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

36
00:02:33,657 --> 00:02:36,657
Sehemu ya 2: Utafiti wa Maeneo Maarufu nchini Japani

37
00:02:36,657 --> 00:02:42,366
Tutafute maeneo maarufu kwa kutumia kompyuta.

38
00:02:42,390 --> 00:02:47,823
Kwanza, tutazungumzia maeneo maarufu ya Hokkaido.

39
00:02:47,846 --> 00:02:52,351
Sapporo na Otaru ni maarufu.

40
00:02:52,375 --> 00:02:57,849
Ndiyo. Lavenda ya Furano pia ni nzuri sana.

41
00:02:57,873 --> 00:03:01,808
Ni maua ya rangi ya zambarau.

42
00:03:01,832 --> 00:03:04,698
Nimeona picha.

43
00:03:04,721 --> 00:03:08,155
Ni nzuri mno.

44
00:03:08,178 --> 00:03:13,318
Bwawa la Buluu la Biei pia ni maarufu.

45
00:03:13,341 --> 00:03:17,861
Maji ni ya buluu kweli.

46
00:03:17,884 --> 00:03:20,857
Ni mahali ajabu.

47
00:03:20,881 --> 00:03:25,914
Kuna bustani ya wanyama ya Asahiyama pia.

48
00:03:25,937 --> 00:03:29,370
Wanyama wako karibu sana.

49
00:03:29,393 --> 00:03:33,093
Hokkaido ni kubwa sana.

50
00:03:33,116 --> 00:03:37,150
Kuna maeneo mengi ninayotaka kwenda.

51
00:03:37,173 --> 00:03:42,083
Sasa tutaangalia Okinawa.

52
00:03:42,106 --> 00:03:46,842
Barabara ya Kimataifa ya Naha inajulikana sana.

53
00:03:46,865 --> 00:03:52,532
Ndiyo. Ni mahali pazuri kabisa kwa ununaji.

54
00:03:52,555 --> 00:03:56,288
Ngome ya Shuri pia inajulikana, sivyo?

55
00:03:56,311 --> 00:03:59,686
Ni jengo jekundu.

56
00:03:59,709 --> 00:04:02,267
Ndiyo.

57
00:04:02,291 --> 00:04:05,964
Ni mahali muhimu katika historia ya Okinawa.

58
00:04:05,987 --> 00:04:09,895
Je, akwariamu ni nini?

59
00:04:09,919 --> 00:04:13,953
Kuna Akwariamu ya Churaumi.

60
00:04:13,977 --> 00:04:18,482
Ni kubwa sana duniani.

61
00:04:18,505 --> 00:04:22,291
Kuna papa wakubwa, sivyo?

62
00:04:22,315 --> 00:04:27,148
Ndiyo. Papa wa Whale wanaogelea huko.

63
00:04:27,171 --> 00:04:31,323
Ufukwe wa Kouri-jima pia ni mzuri sana.

64
00:04:31,347 --> 00:04:35,662
Tunapita daraja refu kwa gari.

65
00:04:35,685 --> 00:04:39,118
Mandhari ni nzuri kabisa.

66
00:04:39,141 --> 00:04:44,779
Mahali pote maarufu, na ni vigumu kuchagua.

67
00:04:44,803 --> 00:04:47,874
Ni kweli.

68
00:04:47,898 --> 00:04:51,798
Kuchagua ni ngumu.

69
00:04:51,821 --> 00:04:57,626
Kama umeelewa, tafadhali ujibu kwa maoni.

70
00:04:57,626 --> 00:05:00,626
Sehemu ya 3: Mipango ya Safari ya Likizo ya Kiangazi

71
00:05:00,626 --> 00:05:07,259
Hata Hokkaido na Okinawa sipati kuziacha.

72
00:05:07,282 --> 00:05:10,315
Mimi pia sawa.

73
00:05:10,338 --> 00:05:13,605
Nataka kwenda zote mbili.

74
00:05:13,628 --> 00:05:17,861
Basi, twende zote mbili.

75
00:05:17,884 --> 00:05:20,518
Kweli?

76
00:05:20,541 --> 00:05:23,614
Tutakwenda zote mbili?

77
00:05:23,637 --> 00:05:25,871
Ndiyo.

78
00:05:25,893 --> 00:05:30,160
Likizo ya kiangazi ya mwaka huu ni ndefu.

79
00:05:30,183 --> 00:05:33,132
Kuna wiki mbili.

80
00:05:33,156 --> 00:05:37,489
Wiki mbili ni nzuri sana.

81
00:05:37,512 --> 00:05:41,279
Tuna muda wa kutosha.

82
00:05:41,302 --> 00:05:46,606
Wiki ya kwanza tutaenda Hokkaido.

83
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:49,336
Sawa sawa.

84
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:53,112
Tuanze na mahali penye baridi.

85
00:05:53,136 --> 00:05:58,202
Baadaye, tutarudi Tokyo mara moja.

86
00:05:58,225 --> 00:06:02,294
Kisha tutaenda Okinawa.

87
00:06:02,318 --> 00:06:05,784
Mpango wa kufaa kabisa.

88
00:06:05,807 --> 00:06:09,401
Tununue tiketi za ndege.

89
00:06:09,425 --> 00:06:13,997
Sasa tiketi za kiangazi ni rahisi.

90
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:17,120
Tuweke reserve mapema.

91
00:06:17,143 --> 00:06:20,410
Tutafute hoteli pia.

92
00:06:20,433 --> 00:06:24,333
Hoteli za Sapporo na Naha.

93
00:06:24,356 --> 00:06:28,623
Hoteli karibu na stesheni ni nzuri.

94
00:06:28,646 --> 00:06:32,746
Ndiyo, usafiri utakuwa rahisi.

95
00:06:32,769 --> 00:06:36,888
Je, tunahitaji gari la kukodisha?

96
00:06:36,911 --> 00:06:39,044
Ndiyo.

97
00:06:39,067 --> 00:06:42,934
Tutatumia Furano na Kouri-jima.

98
00:06:42,957 --> 00:06:47,109
Mimi nitasafirisha gari.

99
00:06:47,132 --> 00:06:49,832
Asante.

100
00:06:49,855 --> 00:06:53,589
Mimi nitafanya kazi ya ramani.

101
00:06:53,612 --> 00:06:57,878
Safari itakuwa ya furaha.

102
00:06:57,901 --> 00:06:59,881
Ndiyo.

103
00:06:59,904 --> 00:07:02,973
Tukajiandae upesi.

104
00:07:02,996 --> 00:07:05,996
Sehemu ya 4: Utalii wa Sapporo na Otaru

105
00:07:05,996 --> 00:07:09,937
Tumefika Sapporo.

106
00:07:09,961 --> 00:07:14,337
Hewa ni tamu sana hapa.

107
00:07:14,361 --> 00:07:18,927
Tuvuke kwenye bustani ya barabara kuu.

108
00:07:18,950 --> 00:07:23,117
Kuna mimea mingi ya kijani.

109
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:28,898
Kule kuna mnara wa televisheni.

110
00:07:28,922 --> 00:07:31,704
Ni mrefu sana.

111
00:07:31,727 --> 00:07:36,594
Mnara wa saa pia uko karibu.

112
00:07:36,617 --> 00:07:40,252
Ni jengo la zamani.

113
00:07:40,276 --> 00:07:46,475
Mji wa Sapporo ni safi na rahisi kutembea.

114
00:07:46,498 --> 00:07:51,965
Sasa, twende Otaru kwa treni.

115
00:07:51,988 --> 00:07:55,145
Tutafika ndani ya nusu saa.

116
00:07:55,169 --> 00:07:58,869
Tumefika Otaru.

117
00:07:58,892 --> 00:08:03,370
Kuna ghala nyingi za zamani.

118
00:08:03,393 --> 00:08:07,893
Huu ndio mfereji wa Otaru.

119
00:08:07,916 --> 00:08:11,416
Taa za gesi zinakuwa nzuri sana.

120
00:08:11,439 --> 00:08:15,672
Mandhari yenye mapenzi.

121
00:08:15,695 --> 00:08:19,772
Ni mahali palipochukuliwa picha.

122
00:08:19,795 --> 00:08:24,262
Usiku, kuna taa za kuvutia.

123
00:08:24,285 --> 00:08:27,664
Zitakuwa nzuri zaidi.

124
00:08:27,687 --> 00:08:31,633
Nina njaa.

125
00:08:31,657 --> 00:08:35,490
Tukale kitu kitamu.

126
00:08:35,513 --> 00:08:39,883
Otaru inajulikana kwa sushi.

127
00:08:39,906 --> 00:08:43,459
Ninajua mgahawa mzuri.

128
00:08:43,483 --> 00:08:48,858
Nataka kula donburi ya bahari.

129
00:08:48,881 --> 00:08:53,381
Kuna kani na uni nyingi ndani.

130
00:08:53,404 --> 00:08:58,537
Donburi ya bahari ya mgahawa huu ni maarufu.

131
00:08:58,560 --> 00:09:02,693
Samaki ni safi sana.

132
00:09:02,716 --> 00:09:05,616
Tunakula sasa.

133
00:09:05,639 --> 00:09:10,906
Eee, uni ni tamu sana!

134
00:09:10,929 --> 00:09:15,476
Kani pia ina nyama nzito.

135
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:18,800
Ni bora kabisa.

136
00:09:18,823 --> 00:09:23,523
Samaki wa Tokyo ni tofauti kabisa.

137
00:09:23,546 --> 00:09:29,846
Bahari ya Hokkaido ni baridi.

138
00:09:29,869 --> 00:09:34,185
Kwa hiyo samaki huwa tamu.

139
00:09:34,208 --> 00:09:38,975
Tumekula kitu kitamu siku ya kwanza.

140
00:09:38,998 --> 00:09:43,931
Safari ya kesho inanifurahisha pia.

141
00:09:43,954 --> 00:09:46,954
Sehemu ya 5: Safari ya Gari katika Furano na Biei

142
00:09:46,954 --> 00:09:52,621
Leo tutaendesha gari kwa likizo.

143
00:09:52,644 --> 00:09:56,310
Tumefika Furano.

144
00:09:56,333 --> 00:10:01,682
Shamba la lavenda liko mbele yetu.

145
00:10:01,706 --> 00:10:05,373
Ni nzuri mno!

146
00:10:05,396 --> 00:10:09,662
Milima yote ni rangi ya zambarau.

147
00:10:09,685 --> 00:10:13,592
Harufu yake ni nzuri pia.

148
00:10:13,616 --> 00:10:17,322
Upepo ni mzuri.

149
00:10:17,346 --> 00:10:22,048
Tukale meli inayojulikana hapa.

150
00:10:22,072 --> 00:10:24,551
Ndiyo.

151
00:10:24,574 --> 00:10:29,358
Meli ya Furano ni tamu sana.

152
00:10:29,382 --> 00:10:33,349
Ina juisi nyingi.

153
00:10:33,372 --> 00:10:36,872
Ni tamu sana.

154
00:10:36,895 --> 00:10:42,962
Sasa twende ziwa la buluu la Biei.

155
00:10:42,985 --> 00:10:46,251
Tumefika Biei.

156
00:10:46,274 --> 00:10:50,308
Kuna miti mingi iliyopangwa.

157
00:10:50,331 --> 00:10:55,164
Kuna ziwa nyuma ya hapo.

158
00:10:55,187 --> 00:10:57,731
Tazama.

159
00:10:57,754 --> 00:11:04,188
Waa, maji yana rangi ya buluu sana!

160
00:11:04,211 --> 00:11:07,796
Kama buluu ya rangi ya kuchora.

161
00:11:07,819 --> 00:11:10,758
Ni ajabu, sivyo?

162
00:11:10,782 --> 00:11:16,378
Kuna mti mweupe ukiwa ndani ya ziwa.

163
00:11:16,402 --> 00:11:21,757
Mti huu umekauka.

164
00:11:21,780 --> 00:11:26,058
Sawa na mti ulio karibu na kitanda.

165
00:11:26,081 --> 00:11:31,255
Mwanga wa jua unabadilisha rangi ya buluu.

166
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:35,626
Sasa ndio wakati wake wa kupendeza zaidi.

167
00:11:35,650 --> 00:11:40,283
Watu wengi wanachukua picha.

168
00:11:40,306 --> 00:11:45,806
Na sisi pia tuwachukue pamoja.

169
00:11:45,829 --> 00:11:48,462
Ndiyo.

170
00:11:48,485 --> 00:11:52,619
Tutachukua picha karibu na ziwa hili.

171
00:11:52,643 --> 00:11:56,421
Picha nzuri imetoka!

172
00:11:56,444 --> 00:11:59,434
Itakuwa kumbukumbu nzuri.

173
00:11:59,457 --> 00:12:05,527
Asili ya Furano na Biei ni nzuri sana.

174
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:11,384
Ndiyo, safari ya gari huko Hokkaido ni bora kabisa!

175
00:12:11,407 --> 00:12:14,407
Sehemu ya 6: Uvutio wa Zoo ya Asahiyama / Uroho wa Hifadhi ya Wanyama Asahiyama

176
00:12:14,407 --> 00:12:18,002
Tumefika Asahikawa.

177
00:12:18,025 --> 00:12:22,573
Twende kwenye Hifadhi ya Wanyama Asahiyama.

178
00:12:22,596 --> 00:12:28,793
Hifadhi hii inajulikana kwa muundo wake wa kipekee.

179
00:12:28,816 --> 00:12:33,283
Aa, kuna bwawa la pengwini.

180
00:12:33,306 --> 00:12:38,041
Unaweza kuwatazama kutoka chini.

181
00:12:38,064 --> 00:12:41,374
Twende kwenye handaki.

182
00:12:41,397 --> 00:12:44,630
Ni nzuri mno!

183
00:12:44,653 --> 00:12:48,320
Pengwini wanaruka angani!

184
00:12:48,343 --> 00:12:53,710
Wanaswim kwa kasi ndani ya maji.

185
00:12:53,733 --> 00:12:56,712
Kama ndege!

186
00:12:56,735 --> 00:13:01,402
Sasa ni mahali pa dubu mweupe mkubwa.

187
00:13:01,425 --> 00:13:06,208
Dubu alitoa sauti kubwa.

188
00:13:06,231 --> 00:13:10,664
Anajitupa ndani ya maji.

189
00:13:10,687 --> 00:13:14,354
Maji yamefika hapa!

190
00:13:14,377 --> 00:13:17,490
Ni ya kutisha sana!

191
00:13:17,514 --> 00:13:22,654
Kuna bwawa la mifereji ya sili pia.

192
00:13:22,677 --> 00:13:27,473
Aa, sili amepita wima.

193
00:13:27,497 --> 00:13:31,849
Anaswim kwa urahisi.

194
00:13:31,872 --> 00:13:34,572
Ni ya kufurahisha!

195
00:13:34,595 --> 00:13:39,962
Wanyama hawa ni wenye nguvu, na ni furaha kuwatazama.

196
00:13:39,985 --> 00:13:43,718
Tumetembea kwa saa tatu.

197
00:13:43,741 --> 00:13:47,260
Tumekalia kidogo, sivyo?

198
00:13:47,284 --> 00:13:53,550
Twende kula ramen maarufu ya Asahikawa.

199
00:13:53,573 --> 00:13:57,943
Kuna mgahawa maarufu wa ramen ya shoyu.

200
00:13:57,967 --> 00:14:02,564
Supu yenye joto ni tamu sana.

201
00:14:02,587 --> 00:14:05,854
Nyama zimekunja.

202
00:14:05,877 --> 00:14:09,810
Chashu pia ni laini.

203
00:14:09,833 --> 00:14:13,700
Nimekula kutosha.

204
00:14:13,723 --> 00:14:18,856
Siku ya mwisho huko Hokkaido ilikuwa ya kuridhisha kabisa.

205
00:14:18,879 --> 00:14:24,032
Kesho tutarudi Tokyo.

206
00:14:24,055 --> 00:14:27,055
Sehemu ya 7: Mwanzo wa Safari ya Okinawa / Mwanzo wa Safari ya Okinawa

207
00:14:27,055 --> 00:14:31,201
Tumefika Uwanja wa Ndege wa Naha.

208
00:14:31,225 --> 00:14:34,730
Joto sana, sivyo?

209
00:14:34,754 --> 00:14:37,143
Ndiyo.

210
00:14:37,166 --> 00:14:43,533
Jua la Okinawa wakati wa kiangazi ni kali sana.

211
00:14:43,556 --> 00:14:47,549
Anga la buluu ni zuri sana.

212
00:14:47,573 --> 00:14:52,639
Kwanza tutembelee barabara ya Kimataifa.

213
00:14:52,662 --> 00:14:58,002
Hapa kuna maduka mengi ya zawadi.

214
00:14:58,026 --> 00:15:02,659
Kuna vitamishi vya Okinawa hapa.

215
00:15:02,682 --> 00:15:06,467
Ninataka kununua chinsuko.

216
00:15:06,491 --> 00:15:11,524
Tart ya ube mwekundu pia ni tamu sana.

217
00:15:11,547 --> 00:15:16,181
Kuna vitu vingi visivyojulikana.

218
00:15:16,204 --> 00:15:19,704
Hautachokesha kuangalia.

219
00:15:19,727 --> 00:15:24,309
Sasa ni muda wa chakula cha mchana, nina njaa.

220
00:15:24,332 --> 00:15:27,999
Tutakula Okinawa soba.

221
00:15:28,022 --> 00:15:32,688
Je, ni tofauti kidogo na ramen?

222
00:15:32,711 --> 00:15:38,611
Ndiyo, ni tambi nyeupe kama udon.

223
00:15:38,634 --> 00:15:42,968
Kuna nyama kubwa ya nguruwe juu yake.

224
00:15:42,991 --> 00:15:48,857
Supu ni nyepesi na tamu sana.

225
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:54,755
Ukizidisha beni nyekundu, ladha itabadilika.

226
00:15:54,779 --> 00:15:57,812
Ni kweli.

227
00:15:57,835 --> 00:16:00,969
Inakuwa safi mno.

228
00:16:00,992 --> 00:16:05,825
Sasa tutaenda Kasri ya Shuri.

229
00:16:05,848 --> 00:16:09,805
Mlango wa Kasri ya Shuri umeonekana.

230
00:16:09,828 --> 00:16:13,261
Ni kubwa mno.

231
00:16:13,284 --> 00:16:17,551
Jengo lote ni jekundu.

232
00:16:17,574 --> 00:16:21,607
Kuna athari ya Uchina.

233
00:16:21,630 --> 00:16:26,786
Ni tofauti kabisa na ngome zingine za Japani.

234
00:16:26,810 --> 00:16:33,543
Ndiyo, unaweza kujua historia ya Ufalme wa Ryukyu wa zamani.

235
00:16:33,566 --> 00:16:39,108
Ukitazama kutoka mahali pa juu, unaweza kuona bahari ya Naha.

236
00:16:39,131 --> 00:16:42,198
Mandhari ni nzuri sana.

237
00:16:42,221 --> 00:16:48,254
Safari yetu ya kwanza ya utalii huko Okinawa ilikuwa ya furaha.

238
00:16:48,277 --> 00:16:51,277
Sehemu ya 8: Papa Mkubwa wa Jinbe katika Hifadhi ya Maji

239
00:16:51,277 --> 00:16:55,944
Tumefika kwenye Akvariamu ya Churaumi.

240
00:16:55,967 --> 00:16:59,839
Jengo ni kubwa sana.

241
00:16:59,862 --> 00:17:05,329
Twende kwenye bwawa kubwa zaidi.

242
00:17:05,352 --> 00:17:09,819
Jina lake ni Bahari ya Kuroshio.

243
00:17:09,842 --> 00:17:15,839
Waa, mbele yetu kuna maji ya buluu tu.

244
00:17:15,862 --> 00:17:19,405
Ni kama ukumbi wa sinema.

245
00:17:19,428 --> 00:17:25,214
Kule kuna papa mkubwa wa Jinbe!

246
00:17:25,237 --> 00:17:29,471
Ni mkubwa sana kweli.

247
00:17:29,494 --> 00:17:33,927
Urefu wake ni kama mita kumi?

248
00:17:33,950 --> 00:17:39,453
Ndiyo, zaidi ya mita kumi.

249
00:17:39,476 --> 00:17:43,190
Uzito wake ni tani tisa.

250
00:17:43,214 --> 00:17:46,757
Tani tisa?

251
00:17:46,781 --> 00:17:51,535
Ni samaki mkubwa zaidi duniani.

252
00:17:51,559 --> 00:17:54,870
Ndiyo.

253
00:17:54,893 --> 00:18:00,359
Hula kope za kumi na tatu za kilo kila siku.

254
00:18:00,382 --> 00:18:05,449
Chakula cha kilo thelathini ni kiasi kikubwa.

255
00:18:05,472 --> 00:18:11,572
Karibu na papa wa Jinbe, manta pia wanacheza majini.

256
00:18:11,595 --> 00:18:15,862
Ni taabani (itomakiei).

257
00:18:15,886 --> 00:18:21,429
Mwili wake ni mweusi na huogelea kama anapanda angani.

258
00:18:21,452 --> 00:18:25,486
Mwendo wake ni mzuri sana.

259
00:18:25,509 --> 00:18:29,176
Ni mzuri mno.

260
00:18:29,199 --> 00:18:35,032
Chini kuna papa na taabani wengi waliokulala.

261
00:18:35,055 --> 00:18:40,011
Kuna samaki wengi wa bahari ya kina pia.

262
00:18:40,035 --> 00:18:42,705
Inaangaza.

263
00:18:42,729 --> 00:18:48,462
Mbele ya bwawa hili, huwezi kuchoka kuutazama.

264
00:18:48,485 --> 00:18:53,352
Ndiyo. Kuna viti vya kukalia.

265
00:18:53,375 --> 00:18:56,684
Tukalia hapa.

266
00:18:56,708 --> 00:19:01,301
Dunia ya buluu nzuri sana, sivyo?

267
00:19:01,324 --> 00:19:03,910
Inanipa amani.

268
00:19:03,934 --> 00:19:10,113
Akvariamu ya Okinawa ni ya ajabu sana!

269
00:19:10,136 --> 00:19:15,452
Ndiyo. Ningependa kukaa hapa siku nzima.

270
00:19:15,476 --> 00:19:21,154
Basi, sasa tutazame sehemu ya zawadi.

271
00:19:21,177 --> 00:19:24,177
Mstari wa 9: Udereva wa Kisiwa cha Kouri na Ufuo

272
00:19:24,177 --> 00:19:30,210
Leo tutaendesha gari kwenda Kisiwa cha Kouri.

273
00:19:30,233 --> 00:19:34,428
Nimeona daraja refu!

274
00:19:34,452 --> 00:19:38,918
Hili ndilo daraja la Kisiwa cha Kouri.

275
00:19:38,941 --> 00:19:43,609
Tazama bahari upande wa kushoto na kulia wa daraja.

276
00:19:43,633 --> 00:19:47,100
Rangi ya emeraldi!

277
00:19:47,123 --> 00:19:51,315
Nzuri kabisa, sivyo?

278
00:19:51,339 --> 00:19:57,256
Kama tunakimbia juu ya bahari.

279
00:19:57,279 --> 00:20:00,858
Tumefika kisiwani.

280
00:20:00,881 --> 00:20:03,848
Twende ufukweni.

281
00:20:03,872 --> 00:20:08,856
Mchanga ni mweupe na mzuri sana.

282
00:20:08,879 --> 00:20:11,986
Tembea uchi.

283
00:20:12,009 --> 00:20:15,968
Ina hisi nzuri.

284
00:20:15,992 --> 00:20:19,747
Maji ni safi sana!

285
00:20:19,770 --> 00:20:23,804
Weka miguu yako ndani ya maji.

286
00:20:23,827 --> 00:20:28,927
Ina baridi kidogo na hisi nzuri.

287
00:20:28,950 --> 00:20:34,816
Kuna mwamba unaofanana na moyo mbali.

288
00:20:34,839 --> 00:20:40,373
Huko ni eneo maarufu lenye nguvu.

289
00:20:40,396 --> 00:20:43,529
Tuchukue picha.

290
00:20:43,552 --> 00:20:45,752
Ndiyo.

291
00:20:45,775 --> 00:20:49,972
Sauti ya mawimbi inanipa raha.

292
00:20:49,996 --> 00:20:54,562
Jua ni kali sana, sivyo?

293
00:20:54,585 --> 00:20:57,485
Nitachomwa na jua.

294
00:20:57,508 --> 00:21:02,077
Tunywe maji baridi.

295
00:21:02,101 --> 00:21:05,134
Kuna duka.

296
00:21:05,157 --> 00:21:10,132
Hii ni juisi ya parachichi ya Okinawa.

297
00:21:10,156 --> 00:21:14,656
Ina uchachu na tamu sana.

298
00:21:14,679 --> 00:21:17,312
Ninahisi kama nimepata uhai mpya.

299
00:21:17,335 --> 00:21:23,669
Wakati wa kupumzika ufukweni ni anasa, sivyo?

300
00:21:23,692 --> 00:21:30,880
Ndiyo. Nimesahau maisha ya kila siku yenye haraka Tokyo.

301
00:21:30,903 --> 00:21:37,496
Asili ya Okinawa inatufanya tuwe na nguvu.

302
00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:42,904
Nimefurahi sana kutembelea kisiwa hiki.

303
00:21:42,927 --> 00:21:50,470
Ndiyo. Mandhari ya jioni pia ni nzuri, basi tutangojea.

304
00:21:50,494 --> 00:21:53,494
Mstari wa 10: Kumbukumbu za Safari

305
00:21:53,494 --> 00:21:57,061
Safari imemalizika.

306
00:21:57,085 --> 00:22:00,918
Tumerejea Tokyo.

307
00:22:00,941 --> 00:22:02,974
Ndiyo.

308
00:22:02,997 --> 00:22:09,147
Wiki mbili huko Hokkaido na Okinawa zimepita haraka.

309
00:22:09,171 --> 00:22:14,675
Tumeunda kumbukumbu nyingi za furaha.

310
00:22:14,699 --> 00:22:19,965
Ni ipi iliyokuwa nzuri zaidi kwako?

311
00:22:19,988 --> 00:22:24,422
Siwezi kuchagua.

312
00:22:24,445 --> 00:22:27,911
Zote zilikuwa bora.

313
00:22:27,934 --> 00:22:32,468
Kumbukumbu yako ya Hokkaido ni ipi?

314
00:22:32,491 --> 00:22:37,924
Shamba la lavenda za zambarau huko Furano.

315
00:22:37,947 --> 00:22:40,895
Mandhari ilikuwa nzuri sana.

316
00:22:40,918 --> 00:22:47,152
Pengine huko bustani ya wanyama Asahiyama ilikuwa ya furaha sana.

317
00:22:47,175 --> 00:22:49,052
Ndiyo.

318
00:22:49,076 --> 00:22:54,109
Samaki na rameni pia zilikuwa tamu sana.

319
00:22:54,132 --> 00:22:58,232
Kumbukumbu zako za Okinawa zinaonekana vipi?

320
00:22:58,255 --> 00:23:03,733
Papa mkubwa wa Churaumi Aquarium.

321
00:23:03,757 --> 00:23:07,098
Ilikuwa na nguvu sana.

322
00:23:07,122 --> 00:23:12,455
Bahari ya buluu huko Kouri Island pia ilikuwa nzuri mno.

323
00:23:12,478 --> 00:23:14,797
Ndiyo.

324
00:23:14,821 --> 00:23:19,763
Sijawahi kusahau juisi niliyokunywa kwenye ufuo mweupe.

325
00:23:19,786 --> 00:23:28,252
Tumetumia wakati mzuri katika mazingira ya baridi ya kaskazini na bahari ya joto ya kusini.

326
00:23:28,275 --> 00:23:32,650
Safari ya majira ya joto ilikuwa ya anasa sana.

327
00:23:32,674 --> 00:23:34,741
Ndiyo.

328
00:23:34,764 --> 00:23:40,515
Tumepiga picha nyingi, basi tuunde albamu.

329
00:23:40,539 --> 00:23:43,129
Sawa sawa.

330
00:23:43,152 --> 00:23:46,820
Ninataka kuonyesha marafiki zangu pia.

331
00:23:46,844 --> 00:23:51,744
Majira ya joto ya mwaka ujao tutaenda wapi?

332
00:23:51,766 --> 00:23:56,600
Tutapanga mahali pengine mpya.

333
00:23:56,623 --> 00:23:58,957
Ndiyo.

334
00:23:58,980 --> 00:24:04,219
Tufanye kazi kwa bidii ili tukaweze kusafiri tena.